{"id":"d50f975e656dde50","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-qhornpolyhedron.md","title":"Q-Horn feasibility polyhedron and half-integral rounding","display":"df-qhornpolyhedron — Q-Horn feasibility polyhedron and half-integral rounding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-qhornpolyhedron","aliases":["27-df-qhornpolyhedron"],"display":"df-qhornpolyhedron — Q-Horn feasibility polyhedron and half-integral rounding","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-litset]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§6.10.2 Equation (6.18) and Definition 6.15","source_statement":"Q-Horn feasibility polyhedron and half-integral rounding","source_printed_pages":"317","source_pdf_pages":"341","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-qhornpolyhedron"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-qhornpolyhedron</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-qhornpolyhedron — Q-Horn feasibility polyhedron and half-integral rounding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.10.2 Equation (6.18) and Definition 6.15"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d50f975e656dde50\" href=\"?note=d50f975e656dde50\" title=\"Q-Horn feasibility polyhedron and half-integral rounding\">Q-Horn feasibility polyhedron and half-integral rounding</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"317"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"341"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span>；文字集与求值见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in[0,1]^n\">\\(\\alpha\\in[0,1]^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:[0,1]^n\\to\\{0,\\frac12,1\\}^n\">\\(\\rho:[0,1]^n\\to\\{0,\\frac12,1\\}^n\\)</span> 为定义目标。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a> 的项文字集函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_T\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]:x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\},\\quad N_T\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]:\\bar x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\}\\qquad(T\\in D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_T\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]:x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\},\\quad N_T\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]:\\bar x_i\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(T)\\}\\qquad(T\\in D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_D\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\alpha\\in[0,1]^n:\\forall T\\in D\\;\\left(\\sum_{i\\in P_T}\\alpha_i+\\sum_{j\\in N_T}(1-\\alpha_j)\\leq1\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_D\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\alpha\\in[0,1]^n:\\forall T\\in D\\;\\left(\\sum_{i\\in P_T}\\alpha_i+\\sum_{j\\in N_T}(1-\\alpha_j)\\leq1\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QHornDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n:\\mathcal P_D\\neq\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QHornDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n:\\mathcal P_D\\neq\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho(\\alpha)_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;\\alpha_i&lt;\\frac12,\\\\\\frac12&amp;\\alpha_i=\\frac12,\\\\1&amp;\\alpha_i&gt;\\frac12,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad H(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]:\\alpha_i=\\frac12\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho(\\alpha)_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;\\alpha_i&lt;\\frac12,\\\\\\frac12&amp;\\alpha_i=\\frac12,\\\\1&amp;\\alpha_i&gt;\\frac12,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]),\\qquad H(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\{i\\in[n]:\\alpha_i=\\frac12\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>权重总和≤1 的约束统一包含 Horn 的全0见证与二次 DNF 的全1/2见证。此处 Q-Horn 是给定表示的性质；不把所有表示的 Q-Horn 性与函数的 Q-Horn 性混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level"